OL,3,AHuge crowds turn out in support of
OL,4,Aresidents over Drumcree parade dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FRallies are being held in Portadown on
OL,7,Fboth sides of the Drumcree parade
OL,8,Fdispute as the stand-off between
OL,9,FGarvaghy Road residents and the Orange
OL,10,FOrder continues.
OL,12,FIt comes after the Police Service of
OL,13,FNorthern Ireland (PSNI) said a "major
OL,14,Fpublic safety operation" will continue
OL,15,Fin Portadown this weekend.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
