OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHuge crowds turn out in support of
OL,4,Aresidents over Drumcree parade dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FAddressing thousands of people at an
OL,7,Fevent on the Garvaghy Road, First
OL,8,FMinister and Sinn Fein vice president
OL,9,FMichelle O'Neill said she heard the
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,11,FBryant "talk about being between a rock
OL,12,Fand a hard place", adding she has
OL,13,F"never heard such nonsense, this is
OL,14,Fbetween right and wrong".
OL,16,FSpeaking at Drumcree church, Democratic
OL,17,FUnionist Party (DUP) MP Carla Lockhart
OL,18,Frepeated calls for PSNI Chief Constable
OL,19,FJon Boutcher and his officers to "do
OL,20,Ftheir job" and facilitate the parade,
OL,21,Fdescribing the current impasse as "mob
OL,22,Frule".
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
